Algorithmic references
----------------------

1. Optimal JPEG Huffman tables  (src/KoiCardTexTool/JpegOpt.cs)
   The table-generation algorithm follows libjpeg's jpeg_gen_optimal_table()
   (including the 16-bit code-length limit and the 256 pseudo-symbol step).

       libjpeg  --  Copyright (C) 1991-2020, Thomas G. Lane, Guido Vollbeding
                    Independent JPEG Group (IJG) license.
                    https://www.ijg.org/

   The IJG licence permits use in both free and commercial software provided
   the authors are acknowledged and the software is not misrepresented as
   being from the IJG. This notice serves as that acknowledgement.

2. PNG compression
   Uses .NET's System.IO.Compression.DeflateStream (zlib-ng inside .NET 8,
   zlib licence) plus an adaptive-filter and channel-reduction pass implemented
   in this repository (src/KoiCardTexTool/PngEnc.cs). No zlib source or binary
   is bundled.

3. Radiance HDR (RGBE) codec  (src/KoiCardTexTool/Hdr.cs)
   Implemented from the Radiance file format specification (Greg Ward).
   Uses the official setcolr()/colr_color() round-trip formulas.

